      {
        "ContentType": "Description",
        "SortOrder": 0,
        "Content": "RAY COOKE AUCTIONEERS are delighted to present this superb own-door, ground floor three-bedroom apartment to the market in the ever-popular Lanesborough Mews development, Finglas, Dublin 11. Extending to a generous c.123 sq.m and boasting a B-rated BER, this spacious property is presented in excellent condition throughout and features a stunning newly renovated kitchen, bright open-plan living accommodation and well-proportioned rooms, making it an ideal choice for first-time buyers, those looking to trade down and investors alike.\r\n\r\nThe location is second to none, with every conceivable amenity on your doorstep including Charlestown Shopping Centre, IKEA, DCU, an excellent selection of primary and secondary schools, local shops, cafés, parks and sporting facilities. The area is well serviced by public transport, while the M50 motorway is only minutes away, providing easy access to Dublin Airport, Dublin City Centre and beyond.\r\n\r\nBright and spacious internal living accommodation comprises a welcoming entrance hallway with ample storage, a large open-plan living and dining area with feature fireplace, a stylish newly renovated kitchen complete with breakfast island, three generous double bedrooms including a spacious master bedroom with ensuite, and a large family bathroom. The property further benefits from built-in wardrobes, designated parking and comes to the market vacant with no onward chain, offering purchasers a smooth and straightforward move.\r\n\r\nNo. 60 represents a rare opportunity to acquire a spacious, energy-efficient apartment in a highly sought-after location. Early viewing is highly recommended.\r\n\r\nAdditional Features\r\n• c.123 sq.m\r\n• B BER\r\n• Own-door ground floor apartment\r\n• Three spacious double bedrooms\r\n• Two bathrooms including master ensuite\r\n• Stunning newly renovated kitchen with breakfast island\r\n• Bright and spacious open-plan living and dining area\r\n• Built-in wardrobes\r\n• Designated parking space\r\n• Vacant with no onward chain\r\n• Feature fireplace\r\n• Excellent storage throughout\r\n• Highly efficient B-rated BER\r\n• Fantastic location close to shops, schools and transport links\r\n• Minutes from the M50, Charlestown Shopping Centre and DCU\r\n• Ideal for first-time buyers, downsizers and investors\r\n• Early viewing is highly advised"
      },
      {
        "ContentType": "Negotiator",
        "SortOrder": 10,
        "Content": "Sales Team 14"
      }
